Four independent count derivations (lobby card filter-count, room header
members.length, line watchbar arithmetic, bench slice) disagreed with each
other; the watchbar's behind-the-front-three arithmetic is the '0 in line
while people are benched' bug.  roomCounts(members, room) is now the only
counter: host +1 (no membership row by design), benched men count toward
line AND total, staleness re-applied defensively.  All four sites read from
it; the inline derivations are deleted.  Exported on window.__lc.

New gate 11-count-parity drives the real lobby card, room header, watchbar
and __lc.roomCounts on the parity roster (host + 2 crowd + 3 bench +
2 chairs + 1 kept + 1 stale).  Gate 03-forbidden now passes unmodified.

